window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>No monster can own me. Not even him. The aliens who took me from Earth thought I was small and puny... how wrong they were!</p> <p>Instead, they ended up with a banshee of a human who had no intention of staying abducted.</p> <p>So now this alien maze has its first freedom fighter. I can put my unusual talents involving weaponry to good use, causing as much havoc as I can until I find an escape.</p> <p>Until the day I stumble across his cell.</p> <p>Drega is feral. Raging. Desperate for escape. And when he sets his eyes on me, this handsome as hell dragon shifter wants only one more thing.</p> <p>Me.</p> <p>Against all my red flags, I help him get free and make a run for it. Because if there's one thing you can't do when you're on an alien planet, being hunted by aliens, it's lose your heart.</p> <p>Turns out I'm running from the wrong aliens...</p> <p>Drega will stop at nothing to get what he wants, including me.</p> <p>And I'm not sure I can stop his conquest, even if I wanted to.</p> <p>DREGA is the third in the Fated Mates of the Sarkarnii series and features not-so-friendly friends to lovers, forced proximity, only one cave and one talented double tongue. A dragon shifter who is adamant he cannot fall in love has just discovered fate has other plans, but can he convince his chosen mate?</p> <p>You'll be listening 'til the early hours with all spice, all the steam and all the heat as you always expect from USA TODAY Bestselling author of steamy sci-fi romance Hattie Jacks.</p>"; 
